## Simulated systems and data provenance

- State registration / active company status: deterministic local fixtures attached to synthetic companies.
- Credit bureau: immutable server-side overdue and one-time failure fixtures; no external inquiry.
- Completeness checks: local application and document validation.
- Credit scoring / decision policy: original educational deterministic rules (demo-v1), not a validated credit model or Alfa-Bank internal policy.
- Signature: user-confirmed status transition with explicit demo consent, no legal electronic signature.
- Disbursement: single transactional synthetic reference, no payment network or money transfer.
- Companies, users, company identifiers, financial values and sample TXT documents: authored synthetic fixtures, no sourced personal or credit records.
- No model weights, AI API, external dataset, stock photo, remote web font or image service is included. Icons and abstract CSS illustrations are project code.
- Alfa-Bank and case names identify the supplied hackathon task only. Branding does not imply bank endorsement or real product terms. The case PDF was supplied by the user for requirements analysis and is not redistributed in this repository.

